# GMS brands an enemy every time Blast strikes it and detonates the brand at
# five stacks, on each enemy separately. The fight counts casts rather than
# stacks per enemy, which comes to the same thing against one target -- and one
# target is what a bossing passive is for.
#
# So the fifth Blast is REPLACED by the detonation rather than followed by it:
# an empowered form is the mechanism the game already has, and what it costs is
# one Blast in five. The explosion is worth eighteen of them, so the trade is
# barely visible beside what it pays.
#
# Its 20% ignored defence is the point of the skill. It rides the swing alone,
# which is what an ied_pct on an attack means -- see WithoutSwingLevers.
name: "Divine Judgment"
skill_order: 3
description:
  "Marks enemies struck by Blast with a Divine Brand. At full stacks the brand "
  "detonates, dealing damage that ignores some of the enemy's Defense."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_PALADIN
max_level: 30
exceeds_master_level: true
required_skill {
  skill_name: "Blast"
  level: 5
}
boosts_skill_name: "Blast"
empowered_form {
  casts_per_trigger: 5
  max_enemies: 1
  lines: 10
  base {
    skill_pct: 4.34
    ied_pct: 0.20
  }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.04 }
}
